.TH ANDARU\-ENGINE 8 "" "Andaru" "Andaru Manual"
.nh
.ad l
.SH NAME
andaru\-engine \- run the Andaru engine
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
andaru engine [\-\-socket PATH] [\-\-state\-dir PATH]
              [\-\-web\-socket PATH \-\-web\-uid UID \-\-web\-gid GID
               \-\-web\-origin HTTPS_ORIGIN ...]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run the Andaru engine: it owns the state directory and serves the root\-only local API on a Unix socket. The web options also serve a dedicated socket to andaru\-web: give \-\-web\-socket and at least one \-\-web\-origin, and \-\-web\-uid and \-\-web\-gid unless /etc/andaru/engine\-web\-peer holds them.
.SH OPTIONS
.nf
.in 0
  \-\-socket PATH        absolute local engine socket path
                       (default /run/andaru/engine.sock)
  \-\-state\-dir PATH     absolute private state directory
                       (default /var/lib/andaru)
  \-\-web\-socket PATH    absolute dedicated web engine socket path
  \-\-web\-uid UID        exact non\-root static web process UID
  \-\-web\-gid GID        exact non\-root static web socket group GID
  \-\-web\-origin HTTPS_ORIGIN
                       exact HTTPS management origin; repeat for each origin
.fi
.in
